  m_Name: Note_Audio_PowerSystem3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Abandoned Research Station Power
  key: 21
  topic: 4
  boardContentText: Abandoned research station is powered from an external generator
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: 'EMIL: So, look.

    [pause]

    EMIL: There''s a power cable coming
    out of the research station. Leads off somewhere behind the rocks. I''m following
    it.

    [brief silence]

    EMIL: I have a feeling I need to find and turn
    on the right generator. Without it, the station is dead.

    [pause]

    EMIL:
    Maybe that also explains why there are so many in the generator room.

    [longer
    silence, wind]

    EMIL: Half a year ago, I wouldn''t have walked like this.
    I''d have stuck to my route from the house to the lighthouse and back. The cable
    wouldn''t have interested me. The station wouldn''t have interested me.

    [pause]

    EMIL:
    Now I''m following it like a dog on a scent. ...And actually, I''m enjoying it.

    [brief
    silence]

    EMIL: That''s terrible. That I''m enjoying it. After so many years.

    [pause]

    EMIL:
    And at the same time... I might be in trouble. I hope it doesn''t end as catastrophically
    as the last time I disobeyed an order.

    [brief silence]

    EMIL: End of
    recording.

    [click]'
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
